OL,3,GNEWSAI'm unaware of bin strike latest,
OL,4,Asays Greens deputy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deputy leader of the Green Party
OL,7,Fhas admitted she has failed to keep up
OL,8,Fto date with Birmingham's near two-year
OL,9,Fbin strike.
OL,11,FDuring a round of interviews with the
OL,12,FBBC, Rachel Millward said she was
OL,13,Funaware of the latest on the dispute,
OL,14,Fdespite her party jointly running the
OL,15,Fcity council.
OL,17,FAsked by BBC Radio WM's Ed James why
OL,18,Fthe dispute is unresolved despite
OL,19,Frecent suggestions of an imminent deal,
OL,20,FMillward said: "I don't know, because I
OL,21,Fdon't have the briefing."
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
