OL,3,GNEWSAI'm unaware of bin strike latest,
OL,4,Asays Greens deputy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Greens have run the council since
OL,7,FMay, alongside the Lib-Dems and Better
OL,8,FBirmingham Independent Group.
OL,9,F"Extensive efforts continue to be made
OL,10,Fto try to find a lawful and reasonable
OL,11,Fend to this dispute," a council
OL,12,Fspokesperson said.
